		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Floating black football-sized orb with drooping tendrils and a single milk-white eye.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 12, <strong>HP</strong> 21, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 tendril +3 (1d4) or project terror, <strong>MV</strong> double near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +2, <strong>D</strong> +2, <strong>C</strong> +3, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +1, <strong>Ch</strong> +1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 4</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Project Terror</strong>. Mentally transmit terrible visions into mortal minds within near. WIS 15+ or 1d6 WIS damage, coma at 0 WIS.</p><p></p><p><strong>Void Transmission</strong>. Analyze one helpless mortal within close for 1d4 rounds, copying their entire mind and psyche. After analysis is done, transmit the copy to far-away galactic masters.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
